                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>wallet_topup_clicked_percentage</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>= number of sessions where top up link is clicked in talbat Pay dashboard/   number of sessions where talabat Pay page is viewed</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>wallet_topup_card_chosen_percentage</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>= number of sessions where card is chosen after top up link is clicked in talbat Pay dashboard/   number of sessions where top up link is clicked in talbat Pay dashboard</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>wallet_topup_attempted_percentage</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>= number of sessions where &quot;Top up&quot; button is clicked (in the page where the user can enter the amount)/   number of sessions where card is chosen after top up link is clicked in talbat Pay dashboard </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Before 24,10,2022 card choosing was not tracked , </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>and before the card choosing tracking reached full adoption approximately on 06,11,2022  it was: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> number of sessions where &quot;Top up&quot; button is clicked (in the page where the user can enter the amount)/ number of sessions where top up link is clicked in talbat Pay dashboard</run>
